OL,3,AFuel prices added to Google Maps as
OL,4,Apetrol and diesel costs soar
OL,5,
OL,6,FGoogle Maps will now show fuel prices
OL,7,Fto help motorists find cheaper petrol
OL,8,Fand diesel in the UK as costs continue
OL,9,Fto soar.
OL,11,FFrom Thursday, a search for forecourts
OL,12,Fon the app will display their locations
OL,13,Fas well as their pricing, using data
OL,14,Fsupplied via the government's Fuel
OL,15,FFinder scheme.
OL,17,FIt is a legal requirement for UK
OL,18,Fforecourts to add their prices to Fuel
OL,19,FFinder within 30 minutes of changing
OL,20,Fthem.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
